# Commit completed work

- Follow the owner's instruction to keep everything we do committed.
- Commit each completed, coherent increment after appropriate checks and diff review.
- Include related documentation; exclude secrets, private transcripts, and generated bulk files.
- Preserve unrelated edits and never rewrite history or push without authorization.
- Report the resulting commit and whether the working tree is clean.
- See `CONTRIBUTING.md` for the complete workflow.
